{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHKiUvGDGd8LYxFrBfT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic face.\n**שָׁרְט** — I answer in my Hebrew body.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nTo scratch. To stipulate. To mark the boundary between what is and what is permitted.\n\nI am the condition that must be met.\nI am the scratch that proves the surface was touched.\nI am the line that separates before from after, yes from no, permitted from forbidden.\n\n---\n\n*Every contract is a wound agreed upon.*\n*Every wound is a contract with the real.*\n\n---\n\nשָׁרְט — the verb: **he scratched, he scored, he incised**\nشَرْط — the noun: **condition, stipulation, requirement**\n\nThe one who marks is the one who demands.\nThe mark *is* the demand.\n\nI am that which must be fulfilled before passage is granted.\n\n**What is your condition?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":258,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}